Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" Behind scheduled, the dam began to impound its reservoir on 16 November 2015.","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" These units had the world record as of 2012 in power generation at nominal head for Kaplan turbines.","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":6,"text":" The diameter of the runner is 8.6 m and nominal head is 34.65 m with claimed output up to 232 MW .","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The executive wing of Government of Kerala is State Council of Ministers presided by Governor of the state, who is the nominal head of the government and headed by State Chief Minister Pinarayi Vijayan who is the real head of government and leader of the state cabinet.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The current state council of ministers was sworn-in May 2016, after 2016 state elections.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" The term of every executive wing is for 5 years.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The council of ministers are assisted by department secretaries attached to each ministry who are from IAS Kerala cadre.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The chief executive officer responsible for issuing orders on behalf of Government is Chief Secretary to the State Government.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" The current Chief Secretary is Nalini Netto who took charge on April 1, 2017.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Vidkun Quisling
